        "code": {
          "text": "Right foot lesion examination"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "On the dorsum of the right foot at the base of the 4th toe: approximately 6–7 mm, firm, well-circumscribed, slightly raised dermal papule with a tan-brown colour and smooth surface. Dimple sign present on lateral compression."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-8",
